{"id":"6e0284ee2456e214","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive Coanalytic Code","display":"df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code — ZFC Descriptive Coanalytic Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code — ZFC Descriptive Coanalytic Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code — ZFC Descriptive Coanalytic Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a89278846ca9cc1\" href=\"?note=0a89278846ca9cc1\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md\">../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,A\\in V\">\\(T,A\\in V\\)</span> (tree code and coded set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveCoanalyticCode}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveCoanalyticCode}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\omega^\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\omega^\\omega}\\)</span> (coanalytic predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a89278846ca9cc1\" href=\"?note=0a89278846ca9cc1\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md\">../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> (natural-number set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\">\\(A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\">\\(A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\">\\(|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\)</span> 仅对有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 使用；函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveCoanalyticCode}_S(T,A) \\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\bigl[\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\;\\langle s{\\upharpoonright}n,t{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T\\bigr)\\bigr]\\land A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land \\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\omega^\\omega}(A)\\land \\omega^\\omega\\setminus A=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x{\\upharpoonright}n,y{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveCoanalyticCode}_S(T,A) \\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\bigl[\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\;\\langle s{\\upharpoonright}n,t{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T\\bigr)\\bigr]\\land A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land \\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\omega^\\omega}(A)\\land \\omega^\\omega\\setminus A=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x{\\upharpoonright}n,y{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The tree consists of pairs of finite sequences on the same level and is closed under simultaneous initial segments; its projection codes the complement of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"0a89278846ca9cc1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"0a89278846ca9cc1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\omega^\\omega}$ (coanalytic predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-coanalytic.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$ (natural-number set, see [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n$，$A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}$，$|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)$ 仅对有限序列 $s$ 使用；函数图见 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]，$\\omega$ 见 [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n$，$A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}$，$|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)$ 仅对有限序列 $s$ 使用；函数图见 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]，$\\omega$ 见 [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveCoanalyticCode}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\omega^\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n","display":false},{"tex":"A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveCoanalyticCode}_S(T,A) \\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}\\times\\omega^{<\\omega}\\land\\bigl[\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\;\\langle s{\\upharpoonright}n,t{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T\\bigr)\\bigr]\\land A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land \\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\omega^\\omega}(A)\\land \\omega^\\omega\\setminus A=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x{\\upharpoonright}n,y{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1804","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive-coanalytic-code]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0a89278846ca9cc1","5045d216c83e75cb","36d7463d215be751"]}